154
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,517
Just keep working.

155
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,835
Shut those STLs down.

156
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,390
Okay.

157
00:12:24,020 --> 00:12:25,160
Say, Higa.

158
00:12:25,900 --> 00:12:28,800
You don't need me right now, do you? No.

159
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:30,170
Wait!

160
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,967
You're not going down there!

161
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:32,960
Don't worry.

162
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:35,857
I just want to scope out
the situation, is all.

163
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:37,293
It shouldn't take long.

164
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:39,036
A few minutes, Tops.

165
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:42,080
Well, see you in a bit. Good luck.

166
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,788
Watch your back down there.

167
