Hi, Rank!

174
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:49,250
Akihiko!

175
00:13:49,333 --> 00:13:50,300
It's you!

176
00:13:57,740 --> 00:13:59,897
I'm sorry I left you on your own.

177
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:01,117
The way I did.

178
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,897
You've been here?

179
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:04,500
All this time?

180
00:14:06,540 --> 00:14:09,380
Rank, I was blessed to
have you in my life.

181
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:11,597
I was so lost in my work,

182
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:15,177
and you were the only thing keeping
me connected to the real world.

183
00:14:15,260 --> 00:14:19,280
And now, I'd like you to
maintain that connection.

184
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:23,680
Bridge the gap between the
real and virtual worlds.

185
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:26,220
Fulfill my dream.

186
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,960
Yes, I will.

187
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:31,720
I will.

188
00:14:45,540 --> 00:14:47,187
It's getting shot to pieces.

189
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:48,250
I better move.

190
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:56,980
Are you hit?

191
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:02,310
Akihiko.

192
00:15:15,700 --> 00:15:18,380
Oh no, the battery cable's damaged.

193
00:15:18,780 --> 00:15:22,015
