before it stops functioning.

194
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:24,720
I'll make it.

195
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,200
You can do it.

196
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:40,400
Please, Akihiko!

197
00:15:52,020 --> 00:15:54,520
He had lost power.

198
00:15:55,460 --> 00:15:56,360
That's it.

199
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,240
Come on, Akihiko!

200
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:05,486
Your Heathcliff of the
Divine Blade, remember?

201
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:10,506
The greatest rival kiddy-toe the Black
Sourceman ever had, and he never gave up!

202
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:14,920
If that kid could do the
impossible, then so can you!

203
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,360
I can't believe it. It's moving.

204
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:18,060
You did it.

205
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:46,200
Looks like they disarmed the bomb.

206
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:49,800
I can't believe Hans decided to stay.

207
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:54,077
Well, him and Brig were
always tight, so...

208
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:56,540
That's that, I guess.

209
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:00,060
Only two?

210
