Damn it, Shaq! What?

211
00:18:03,260 --> 00:18:06,337
Didn't I tell you guys to
grab and bag all the bodies?

212
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:09,220
There's only two of them here. Well, yeah.

213
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,557
There was only Brig and Captain Miller.

214
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,522
We did a sweep and they were it.

215
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:18,400
But wasn't there one more in the STL room?

216
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:21,520
No, man. Just the cap. That's it.

217
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:24,920
His face freaked the hell out of me.

218
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:38,440
Rank, log out for Kirito
and Asuna is almost done.

219
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,040
One minute to go.

220
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:42,050
All right.

221
00:18:42,133 --> 00:18:42,963
Hang in there.

222
00:18:43,046 --> 00:18:44,637
I'll send someone down to get you.

223
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,550
Thanks.

224
00:18:45,633 --> 00:18:49,384
In the shape I'm in, I doubt I'd
make it one rung up this ladder.

225
00:18:49,940 --> 00:18:53,257
Heeks went down to check on whatever
was going on with the engine.

226
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:55,693
He was bleeding pretty bad when he left.

227
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:57,631
Do you know if he's okay?

228
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:59,689
Oh, he's better than okay.

229
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:01,844
He ran in there guns a-blazing.

230
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:04,315
Just like the hero in an action movie.

231
00:19:04,980 --> 00:19:06,720
I wish I saw that.

232
00:19:07,560 --> 00:19:08,390
Oh, sweet.

233
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:10,564
Thirty seconds left to log out.

234
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:13,253
Okay, I'll head over to Kirigaya's room.

235
00:19:13,520 --> 00:19:15,737
I've got my comms on if you need anything.

236
00:19:15,820 --> 00:19:16,650
Over.

237
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:19,000
Dr. Kochiro, come in.

238
00:19:19,100 --> 00:19:25,577
We're uh in the engine room yes i'm
here is something wrong well we removed

239
00:19:25,660 --> 00:19:28,477
the explosive from the tank but um

240
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:33,717
Niemon he's um gone

241
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:36,240
what where'd he go

242
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:44,660
come on guys come back to us
please be okay please Please.

243
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:44,380
Thank you so much for watching.

244
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:29,000
